d / A2UI+AG-UI adapter-only), 13.7 Model Gateway (3 API surfaces, A/B access classes, ModelCall full-content-on-tape default w/ honest replay-degradation when redacted), 13.8 Capability Registry (Install != trust; undeclared action class fail-closed), 13.9 Skill Library (SKILL.md-compatible + law shell, 12 initial skills), 13.10 Live Software 3.0 (= loop-3 data flywheel; white-box scaffolding only, never black-box self-mutation; per-base-model adapter retraining tax stated; holdout eval anti-Goodhart), 14.4 External Agent Adapter Contract (Git-first), roadmap single-ladder merge (alpha/beta/M1-M4), non-negotiables 17-21. S-stage: 2 opus critics + haiku lint, all readVerification-proven. Results: fidelity 1 blocker (user review point 8 community-stickiness research SILENTLY DROPPED - fixed by honest deferral declaration in 14.4 + FEASIBILITY Part III item 13; the research itself deferred to its own atom) + 3 risks; honesty 0 blockers + 3 risks (06-15 date hedged with 据报道, MCP Apps date anchor mirrored, vendor:verified clarified as identity-attestation-not-quality); lint clean. Atom predicates ALL PASS; shipgate p1 16/16 PASS. Parallel R1.9 session dirty files untouched. PR #26 updated to v0.5, awaiting user final review (no auto-merge). Implementation plan (落地计划) intentionally NOT written this atom - 4 user decisions pending (Tier-2 anchor form, inbound A2A, registry hosting, adapter-training timing); next atom after ratification.
